        <node type="node/const/perm/general" idtf="" shapeColor="0" id="3001467421168" parent="0" x="798.38" y="424.604" haveBus="false" idtf_pos="0">
            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[Периметр равностороннего треугольника BCD равен 30 см, то все его стороны BC, BD, DC равны соответственно 10 см.]]></content>
        </node>
        <node type="node/const/perm/general" idtf="" shapeColor="0" id="3001467422832" parent="0" x="1107" y="574.552" haveBus="false" idtf_pos="0">
            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[The perimeter of a right triangle BCD is 30 cm, then all its sides BC, BD, DC are 10 cm, respectively.]]></content>
        </node>
        <node type="node/const/perm/general" idtf="" shapeColor="0" id="3001467419296" parent="0" x="1110.73" y="1191.67" haveBus="false" idtf_pos="0">
            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[В равнобедренном треугольнике ABD BD равно 10 см, AB равно AD, а периметр равен 22 см, то AB и AD равны 6 см соответственно.]]></content>
        </node>
        <node type="node/const/perm/general" idtf="" shapeColor="0" id="3001467419712" parent="0" x="843.51" y="1337.37" haveBus="false" idtf_pos="0">
            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[In an isosceles triangle ABD BD is 10 cm, AB equal AD, and the perimeter is 22 cm, then AB and AD are 6 cm, respectively.]]></content>
        </node>
        <node type="node/const/perm/general" idtf="" shapeColor="0" id="3001467419920" parent="0" x="1081.92" y="1770.47" haveBus="false" idtf_pos="0">
            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[В четырёхугольнике ABCD AB=6, BC=10, CD=10, AD=6 см, то его периметр равен 32 см соответственно.]]></content>
        </node>
        <node type="node/const/perm/general" idtf="" shapeColor="0" id="3001467421584" parent="0" x="1077.7" y="2092.17" haveBus="false" idtf_pos="0">
            <content type="1" mime_type="content/term" content_visibility="true" file_name=""><![CDATA[The quadrilateral ABCD has AB=6, BC=10, CD=10, AD=6 cm, then its perimeter is 32 cm, respectively.]]></content>
        </node>
